   "JobDescription": "<p><strong>Job Requirements</strong></p><ul><li><p>Design, build and maintain backend services in C# / .NET Core.</p></li><li><p>Develop responsive, high-performance front-ends in Angular.</p></li><li><p>Design and document REST APIs and integrate third-party services.</p></li><li><p>Design, optimize and maintain relational databases (SQL Server / PostgreSQL).</p></li><li><p>Deploy and maintain applications on cloud platforms (AWS / Azure) using CI/CD.</p></li><li><p>Write clean, tested, maintainable code and take part in code reviews.</p></li><li><p>Troubleshoot production issues and improve performance and security.</p></li><li><p>Work with product and blockchain teams to deliver features on time.</p></li></ul><p><strong>Educational Requirements</strong></p><p>Bachelor's degree in CSE, SWE, ICT or a related field.</p><p><strong>Experience</strong></p><ul><li><p>2 to 5 years in software development (C# / .NET and Angular)</p></li><li><p>Candidates with strong project experience may also apply.</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Requirements</strong></p><p>• Strong experience with C#, .NET Core, ASP.NET Web API and Entity Framework.</p><p>• Hands-on Angular (TypeScript, RxJS, component architecture) for scalable UIs.</p><p>• Solid understanding of REST APIs, authentication (JWT / OAuth) and security basics.</p><p>• Experience with SQL databases: schema design, queries and optimization.</p><p>• Experience with cloud deployment, Docker and CI/CD pipelines.</p><p>• Good understanding of Git, Agile practices and clean code principles.</p><p><strong>Nice to have</strong></p><p>• Experience with microservices, Redis or message queues.</p><p>• Exposure to blockchain, Web3, or integrating external data and APIs.</p><p>• Unit testing (xUnit, Jasmine/Karma).</p><p></p><p>Application Deadline: 05/11/2026</p><p>How to Apply: Send your CV, GitHub/portfolio link and expected salary to [email] with the subject line \"Full Stack Developer (C#/Angular) – [Your Name]\".</p>",
